 == Market position and reception ==
 
-Coverage of Collibra has often treated the company as part of a wider enterprise shift toward making data more discoverable, reliable, and governable across large organizations.<ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2020-04-02--9b72eaaf"/><ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2021-11-09--b651224f"/><ref name="ref-https-www-cnbc-com-2021-11-09-co-b492b371"/> Publications have described the company in varying terms, including data governance, data management, and data intelligence, while consistently placing it in the market for enterprise software used to control and operationalize data.<ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2020-04-02--9b72eaaf"/><ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2021-11-09--b651224f"/><ref name="ref-https-www-cnbc-com-2021-11-09-co-b492b371"/> That coverage has generally appeared in business and trade publications rather than consumer-oriented media, reflecting the specialized enterprise market in which the company operates.<ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2020-04-02--9b72eaaf"/><ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2021-11-09--b651224f"/><ref name="ref-https-www-hln-be-de-krant-datasp-e5791e93"/>
-
-Across multiple years, coverage of Collibra's funding rounds, acquisitions, and product expansion described the company as part of a sustained market trend around governance, trust, compliance, analytics enablement, and later AI governance rather than as a single isolated startup story.<ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2020-04-02--9b72eaaf"/><ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2021-11-09--b651224f"/><ref name="ref-https-www-hln-be-de-krant-datasp-e5791e93"/><ref name="ref-https-www-techtarget-com-searchd-2d386cbd"/><ref name="ref-https-www-techtarget-com-searchd-cf67b7bb"/> Later coverage connected that position to AI governance and data-access controls as those topics became more prominent in enterprise software.<ref name="ref-https-www-techtarget-com-searchd-2d386cbd"/><ref name="ref-https-www-techtarget-com-searchd-cf67b7bb"/>
+Coverage of Collibra has often treated the company as part of a wider enterprise shift toward making data more discoverable, reliable, and governable across large organizations.<ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2020-04-02--9b72eaaf"/><ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2021-11-09--b651224f"/> Publications have described the company in varying terms, including data governance, data management, and data intelligence, while consistently placing it in the market for enterprise software used to control and operationalize data.<ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2020-04-02--9b72eaaf"/><ref name="ref-https-techcrunch-com-2021-11-09--b651224f"/> Later coverage connected that position to AI governance and data-access controls as those topics became more prominent in enterprise software.<ref name="ref-https-www-techtarget-com-searchd-cf67b7bb"/>
 
